<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="zh-tw"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><style>*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}html{font-size:16px}body{font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",Roboto,sans-serif;background:#f5f5f5;color:#333;min-height:100vh;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}.c{text-align:center;max-width:34rem;padding:2.5rem 1.25rem}#j{font-size:7.5rem;font-weight:300;color:#999;margin-bottom:1.25rem;line-height:1}#k{font-size:1.5rem;font-weight:300;color:#666;margin-bottom:1.875rem}#l{font-size:1rem;color:#777;margin-bottom:2rem;line-height:1.6}@media(max-width:30rem){#j{font-size:5rem}#k{font-size:1.125rem}}</style><title>401 - 未授權</title></head><body><div class="c"><h1 id="j">401</h1><h2 id="k">未授權</h2><div id="l">存取此資源需要身份驗證。請提供有效的憑證並重新嘗試。</div></div></body></html>